(PaadhAI is an all-in-one, subject-agnostic web platform engineered for undergraduate and graduate college students) Tj
T* (across engineering, sciences, commerce, and humanities. It combines topic-level syllabus tracking, context-aware) Tj
T* (AI doubt resolution, centralized study materials, and past-year examination paper analysis into a single unified) Tj
T* (workspace. The platform directly eliminates exam preparation anxiety by clarifying what to study next, delivering fast) Tj
T* (explanations, and pinpointing high-frequency question patterns.) Tj
ET
