/F1 9.5 Tf
12.8250000000000011 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
54. 680.3899999999999864 Td
(The production release features a decoupled architecture: a high-responsiveness Next.js 16 \(React 19\) frontend) Tj
T* (deployed on Vercel under the production domain paadhai.online, a high-throughput Python FastAPI microservice) Tj
T* (deployed on Railway for heavy PDF processing, Neon Serverless PostgreSQL for scalable persistence, Clerk for) Tj
T* (resilient multi-session authentication, and Google Gemini API for fast, cost-effective reasoning within a) Tj
T* ($5-$10/month operational budget.) Tj
